    "## Приложения"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### A. Физические основы SUV"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\\text{SUV} = \\frac{\\text{Activity}_{\\text{voxel}} \\times \\text{PatientWeight}}{\\text{InjectedDose}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "где:\n",
    "- Activity_voxel: Активность в вокселе [kBq/ml]\n",
    "- PatientWeight: Вес пациента [kg]\n",
    "- InjectedDose: Введённая активность [kBq]\n",
    "\n",
    "### B. Recovery Coefficient"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\\text{RC} = \\frac{\\text{Measured SUV}}{\\text{True SUV}}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Идеальное значение: RC = 1.0\n",
    "\n",
    "### C. Коэффициент вариации (шум)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\\%\\text{CV} = 100 \\times \\frac{\\sigma_{\\text{background}}}{\\mu_{\\text{background}}}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### D. Литература"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
