    "2. NEMA NU-2-2018. \"Performance Measurements of Positron Emission Tomographs.\"\n",
    "3. EANM Research Ltd. (EARL) Accreditation Standards for PET/CT\n",
    "4. Boellaard R, et al. \"FDG PET and PET/CT: EANM procedure guidelines for tumour PET imaging.\" Eur J Nucl Med Mol Imaging. 2015"
   ]
